$$1005 \mid (6 + 2009m)$$

Since $2009 \equiv -1 \pmod{1005}$, this gives $6 - m \equiv 0 \pmod{1005}$, i.e.:
$$m \equiv 6 \pmod{1005}$$

Write $m = 6 + 1005t$ for integer $t$.

## Finding When $2010 \mid a_n$

